    "Cost": 1081489,
    "UIName": "Commando",
    "Id": "chassisdef_commando_COM-7Y2",
    "Name": "Commando",
    "Details": "The -7Y2 is more than just a sub-variant of the -7Y, it has become so famous and beloved it earned its own nickname of the 'Blazing Inferno'. It sacrifices the SRM launchers, but instead adds 6 small lasers. The only downside of the variant is its quite bad cooling capabilities considering all its weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.96</color></b>",
